#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:222
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_IntroSpeech"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: Welcome, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"That incident in SOOTOPOLIS CITY…\n"
"That was superb work, putting an end\l"
"to that crisis all by yourself.\p"
"Oops!\p"
"It wouldn't be fair to say that you\n"
"alone ended the crisis.\p"
"You overcame that difficult situation\n"
"by working as one with your POKéMON.\p"
"We TRAINERS raise POKéMON by giving\n"
"them items and by teaching them new\l"
"techniques for battle.\p"
"But we ourselves also learn many\n"
"things from POKéMON.\p"
"And this is where your achievements\n"
"are put to the test against what\l"
"others like you have achieved.\p"
"Now!\p"
"Who can most elegantly dance with\n"
"their POKéMON in HOENN?\p"
"Show me right here and now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:245
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat"
msgid ""
"I, the CHAMPION, fall in defeat…\p"
"That was wonderful work.\n"
"You were elegant, infuriatingly so.\l"
"And yet it was utterly glorious!\p"
"Kudos to you, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"You are a truly noble POKéMON\n"
"TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:254
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: The POKéMON you sent into\n"
"battle…\p"
"At times they danced like a spring\n"
"breeze, and at times they struck\l"
"like lightning.\p"
"It was with light, yet surefooted,\n"
"elegance that you led your POKéMON.\p"
"Even I felt bedazzled by your\n"
"masterful performance!\p"
"You now stand at the glorious peak\n"
"of the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
"I now proclaim you to be the new\n"
"HOENN region…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:269
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_MayAdvice"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Here's some advice before you challenge\n"
"the CHAMPION…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:274
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_MayItsAlreadyOver"
msgid ""
"MAY: Huh?\n"
"What, what, what?\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"Could it be that…\l"
"It's already over?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:281
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_BrendanAdvice"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}!\p"
"How would you like some advice before\n"
"you challenge the CHAMPION?…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_BrendanYouveWon"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}…\p"
"Are you trying to tell me…\n"
"You've beaten the CHAMPION?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:291
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_BirchArriveRatePokedex"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: See?\n"
"What did I tell you, {RIVAL}?\p"
"Didn't I tell you that you don't need\n"
"to worry about {PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, you've finally done it.\p"
"When I heard that you defeated your\n"
"own father at the PETALBURG GYM,\l"
"I thought perhaps you had a chance…\p"
"But to think you've actually become\n"
"the CHAMPION!\p"
"Ah, yes!\p"
"What became of your POKéDEX?\n"
"Here, let me see.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:307
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_BirchCongratulations"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Anyways,\n"
"congratulations!\p"
"Now, go proudly into the final room!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:312
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_WallaceComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"No, let me rephrase that properly.\p"
"The new CHAMPION!\p"
"Come with me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_WallaceWaitOutside"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: I'm sorry, but…\p"
"From here on, only those TRAINERS who\n"
"have become CHAMPIONS may enter.\p"
"You'll have to wait outside with\n"
"PROF. BIRCH.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:325
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_MayCongratulations"
msgid ""
"MAY: Groan…\p"
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"I'm just joking! That's okay!\n"
"That's the rule!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Honestly, congratulations!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_ChampionsRoom_Text_BrendanCongratulations"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Whaaaat?! … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"It can't be helped if that's the rule.\p"
"{PLAYER}, way to go!\n"
"Congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
